      "source": "Converts the results of transaction exec using a supplied Queue of <a href=\"../FutureResult.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>FutureResult</code></a>s. Converts any Exception\nobjects returned in the list as well, using the supplied Exception <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a>",
      "translation": "使用提供的 <a href=\"../FutureResult.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.connection\"><code>FutureResult</code></a> 队列转换事务执行的执行结果。同时，也转换列表中返回的任何异常对象，使用提供的异常 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a>。",
